title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $minigame_won = false>>
<<declare $knows_viviana_name = false>>
<<declare $knows_james_name = false>>
<<declare $asked_viviana_james = false>>
<<declare $knows_grace_name = false>>
<<declare $grace_following = false>>
<<declare $knows_daisy_name = false>>
<<declare $asked_daisy_book = false>>
<<declare $asked_daisy_james = false>>
<<declare $knows_kevin_name = false>>
<<declare $asked_kevin_writing = false>>
<<declare $asked_kevin_james = false>>
<<declare $asked_kevin_friends = false>>
<<declare $daisy_following = false>>
<<declare $kevin_following = false>>
<<declare $knows_evan_name = false>>
<<declare $asked_evan_run = false>>
<<declare $asked_evan_bars = false>>
<<declare $asked_evan_james = false>>
<<declare $evan_following = false>>
<<declare $knows_daniel_name = false>>
<<declare $told_daniel_run = false>>
<<declare $asked_daniel_james = false>>
<<declare $asked_daniel_money = false>>
<<declare $daniel_following = false>>
<<declare $knows_ellie_name = false>>
<<declare $knows_andy_name = false>>
===
title: Viviana_Bully_Start
---
Viviana stands beside the sandbox, cardboard sword in hand, cardboard helmet on top, She fiddles with the sand with her sword
She notices you walking towards her, she points the sword towards you
Viviana : State your name!
-> You : I'm Lola.
Viviana : Lola? Never heard of you.
-> You : I'm the new kid.
Viviana : Oh, you're the new kid. 
Viviana : I’m Viviana, Everyone knows me.
<<set $knows_viviana_name to true>> 
Viviana : I’m the fastest in my year
Viviana : I’m friends with the coolest kid in town too! You’ll never guess who he is
<<jump Viviana_Bully_Questions>> 
===
title: Viviana_Bully_Questions
---
-> You : Why do you have that sword? 
	Viviana : Can’t you tell?
	Viviana : I’m a knight!
	*She starts to poke the air rapidly*
	Viviana : Hah! See that? That's what a true knight would do!s
===
title: Viviana_Bully_Marbles
---
You : Grace said you took her marbles
Viviana : She's just trying to make you feel bad
Viviana : Don’t listen to her
Viviana : I don’t have anything. She's lying.
You  : Really? Are you sure, cause she said that you took her marbles 
Viviana : I didn’t take anything, she's lying
Viviana : A Marble Falls out of her pocket
You : Is that a marble
Viviana : No! That's not hers! It’s mine
You  : So it is hers! 
You  : She said it was a special kind of marble
You  : Well you gotta give it back
Viviana : Ok finee
Viviana : I guess I do have her marbles
Viviana : But don't tell her I have them
You : Ok
-> You : I’m telling her
    Viviana : WAIT 
    Viviana : No
    You  : Then give them back
    Viviana : Ugh, Fine
    Viviana : But you have to play a game with me
    Viviana : And only if you win, you can have them 
-> You : Ok i’m gonna go tell James <<if $knows_james_name and not $asked_viviana_james>> 
    Viviana : Don’t!
    Viviana : James is my friend
    You  : Then give them back
    Viviana : Ugh, fine
    Viviana : Just a game, but only if you win
<<if not $knows_james_name>>
    Viviana : James says I'm the fastest. So you'll lose.
    You  : Who's James?
    Viviana : The boy with a skull shirt
    <<set $knows_james_name to true>>
<<endif>>
<<jump Viviana_Bully_Game>>
===
title: Viviana_Bully_Game
---
<<set $minigame_won to false>>
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "marbles">>
<<if $minigame_won>>
    Viviana : One more time.
    <<set_phase "end">>
<<else>>
    Viviana : One more timeee.
<<endif>>
<<set $minigame_won to false>>
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "marbles">>
<<if $minigame_won>>
    Viviana : ...fine. You win. Here are the marbles
    <<set_phase "end">>
<<else>>
    Viviana : Ha! Come back when you're better
<<endif>>
===
title: Viviana_Bully_End
---
Viviana : Ok you won
Viviana : What do you want
-> You : tell me more about james
    Viviana : Ok fine
    Viviana : To be honest he stood out to me
    Viviana : Like
    Viviana : He's so cool
    Viviana : He was at school basketball tryouts 
    Viviana : I think he won
    Viviana : I don’t know
-> You : wait but I wanna play the marbles game with you again
    Viviana : Okay..
    Viviana : What happened to giving grace the marbles back
    You : She let me keep some
===
title: Grace_Victim_Start
---
Grace : sniffle
-> You : What's wrong? 
    Grace : *I don’t really know*
    Grace : sniffle
    Grace : my marbles..
    *She looks up at you*
    Grace : Who are you..
    -> You : I’m Lola, I’m new here
        Grace : Oh.. Hi
    -> You : Lola
        Grace : Oh.. Hi
Grace : I’m Grace
Grace : Hi, Lola
<<set $knows_grace_name to true>> 
You : What's wrong, why are you crying?
Grace : It's Viviana..
You : Who's Viviana? 
Grace : She's the kid over there.
Grace : I ask her to give me my marbles back.
Grace : She keeps saying they got lost.
Grace : And she can’t do anything because it's disappeared
Grace : But I keep seeing her holding the marbles that I gave her
You : How do you know
Grace : They’re the special ones, blue and swirly
<<jump Grace_Victim_Questions>>
===

title: Grace_Victim_Questions
---
-> You : A guy took my bunny today, I’m sad too
    Grace : oh.. Thats mean
    Grace : I know how that feels
    <<jump Grace_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : I’ll help you out
    Grace : Okay.. 
    Grace : can you ask her about the marbles for me? Please?
    You : Yes, I’ll get them back for you
-> You : Did you see a boy with brown hair? He wears a green skull shirt too, He took my bunny. <<if not $knows_james_name>>
    Grace : Brown hair?  A kid with a skull shirt? 
    Grace : Oh.. I think thats James
    Grace : He takes stuff, too. Everybody knows him. 
    <<set $knows_james_name to true>>
    <<jump Grace_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : Okay. I'll get them back.
    Grace : Thank you, Lola!
===
title: Grace_Victim_End
---
Grace : Wait, is that..
You : Yup! I got your marbles back!
Grace : Wowowow! Oh my gosh
Grace : How did you do that?
You : I played a game with Viviana.
Grace : You won a fight with Viviana??!
Grace : Wowowow!
Grace : Can we be friends??
You : Ah.. yeah.. Its nothing
You : Let's be friends!
Grace : Okay!
*Grace hands you a marble*
Grace : Here! You can keep this one!
You : Really? 
Grace : Yeah! It's my favorite marble! I’d say its my lucky marble
You : Oh wow! Thank you
*You start walking off*
You : Alright! I’ll see you then
Grace : Wait! Where are you going? Can I come with you?
You : Huh? Sure! I’m just trying to find James
Grace : Okay! I’ll come with you, lets find this James guy
<<set $grace_following to true>>
===

