title: Daisy_Victim_Start
---
*Daisy sits on the ground, a thick big book with a recognizable cover lays open on her lap*
*Lola notices you staring at her book, you can feel the excitement emitting from her as soon as she notices*
Daisy : Haii!
You : Oh hello!
You : You’re reading Harry Potter?
Daisy : Yeahh! I love this book.
Daisy : It has so many big words though.
You : Yeah I tried to read that book
You : But I think its better if I just read books like Magic Tree House.
Daisy : Oh My Gosh, I love that series, it's splendid! 
You : Yeah!
Daisy : Wow, you sound so cool, we should be friends!
Daisy : What do I call you?
-> You : Call me Lola! I’m new to this school
    Daisy : Oh! A new kid!
-> You : I go by Lola!
    Daisy : Oh. Hi, Lola.
Daisy : I'm Daisy!
<<set $knows_daisy_name to true>>
Daisy : Do you want to sit next to me?
You : Sure!
*You sit next Daisy, you notice a boy on the swing would keep staring towards your area, but you notice its not directly to you, but rather to Daisy*
Daisy : Don’t mind him.. I guess
You : Why? Who is that?
Daisy : That's Kevin, we’re in the same class.
Daisy : But he always glances at me in class.
Daisy : I don’t understand him, really, and he never says anything nice to me either!
You : Oh.. What does he say to you?
Daisy : He says i’m terrible at writing! Mrs. Hampton literally tells me I’m the best writer in the class, like is he making stuff up? I don’t get it!
You : Hes just mean, don’t listen to him.
Daisy : Ugh, but it annoys me so much..
<<jump Daisy_Victim_Questions>> 
===

title: Daisy_Victim_Questions
---
-> You : What Part of the book is your favorite? <<if not $asked_daisy_book>>
    <<set $asked_daisy_book to true>>
    Daisy : When Harry Potter leaves his muggle aunts and aunties
    Daisy : They were literally stopping him
    Daisy : I don’t know.. Reading that part felt so satisfying
    Daisy : Like, you can’t stop him anymore haha
    You : Yeah I remember reading that part, it was satisfying
    Daisy : Right?!
    <<jump Daisy_Victim_Questions>> 
-> You : Do you know James? <<if $knows_james_name and not $asked_daisy_james>>
    <<set $asked_daisy_james to true>>
    Daisy : James?
    Daisy : He's very... distinguished.
    You : uh.. What does that mean?
    Daisy : I don’t know, like unique, different I guess?
    Daisy : He stands out
    <<jump Daisy_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : Do you want me to talk to Kevin?
    Daisy : Sure? I mean if you want yeah
    Daisy : I want to know why he's treating me this way
    Daisy : But I don’t know if I could ask
    You : Okay. I'll ask.
    Daisy : Thanks, Lola!
===

title: Daisy_Victim_End
---
*You and Kevin walk towards Lola, she looks up from reading her book*
You : Hey Daisy, Kevin has something for you
*Daisy glances at you, then glances at Kevin*
Kevin : Uh… hey..
Daisy : Hi.. Kevin..?
*He holds out his paper and hands it towards Daisy, his face flushed red*
Daisy : “You are splendid!”
Daisy : Splendid means good.. Right?
Kevin : Yeah.. I think so..
Daisy : Aw! Thank you Kevin!
Kevin : Yayy
Kevin : Sorry for being mean to you
Daisy : It's okay
Daisy : Sorry, I told Lola you weren’t a nice person
Kevin : It's okay
Daisy : Do you want to read Harry Potter with me?
Kevin : Oh.. I think its okay, too many big words
Daisy : That's ok! I can read it to you
Kevin : Okay..
*Kevin sits next to Daisy. Daisy reads aloud towards Kevin*
Daisy : Lola, you can come too!
Lola : Okayy
<<set $daisy_following to true>>
<<set $kevin_following to true>>
===

title: Kevin_Bully_Start
---
*Kevin notices you approaching him by the swing, he scrambles to open his book and stares at it as you come his way*
Kevin : *Ahem*
Kevin : I saw you talking with Daisy earlier.
You : You saw?
Kevin : Ya.. I’m kinda sitting here anyway.
Kevin : She's right in front of me. I have nothing else to do.
You : Why are you looking at her?
Kevin : Uhmm.
Kevin : I don’t know?
Kevin : She's right in front of me..
You : Technically you can move..
Kevin : No..?
You : How about playing some games with friends..
Kevin : umm..
Kevin : mm
You : ??
Kevin : Do you wanna talk to Daisy for me or something
Kevin : What did she tell you about me
You : Kevin.. I don’t know.. 
Kevin : How do you know my name? Did Daisy tell you or something? 
You : Yeah she told me your name, I’m Lola
<<set $knows_kevin_name to true>> 
Kevin : Oh okay
Kevin : uhhmm
Kevin : I don't know
Kevin : I’m just tired
Kevin : I just wanna sit
Kevin : And read my book I guess
<<jump Kevin_Bully_Questions>> 
===

title: Kevin_Bully_Questions
---
-> You : So what were you reading? <<if not $asked_kevin_writing>>
