title: Andy_Victim_Start
---
*Andy sits on the ground, the grass surrounding him, his gaze seemingly stares off into space. You notice him holding a lollipop stick, the plastic still stuck to the candy, and a frog book is open in front of him*
*You  bump into him*
Andy : Oof!
You : Oh! Sorry. I didn’t see you
You : Why are you sitting on the ground?
Andy : I’m just sad.
Andy : Why are you asking? Who are you?
-> You : I'm Lola. I'm new.
    Andy : Ohhh, thats why I don’t recognize your face.
    Andy : To be fair I don’t really recognize anyone else's face.
-> You : Lola.
    Andy : Ohh, nice name.
Andy : I’m Andy!
Andy : Hi Lola!
<<set $knows_andy_name to true>> 
You : So, why are you sad Andy?
Andy : It's Diana.
You :  Who's Diana?
Andy : The girl sitting on the slide..
Andy : She's really loud, I don’t get it, sometimes her screams hurt my ears, I’m not even near her..
Andy : But she's so outgoing, she can talk to so many people, I wish I could be like that..
Andy : *mumbles*
Andy : And she keeps yelling and points at me.
Andy : *mumbles*
You : Hey.. Um..I don’t think that's a bad thing.
You : Isn’t a nerd just basically someone who is.. Really smart?
Andy : Well she doesn’t think that.
Andy : She runs away every time I go up to her.
Andy : And just screams..
Andy : Nerrrrrrrrd!
Andy : I only talked to her once.
Andy : When I saw her trying to do math, I went behind her and and told her the answers.
You : Is she good at math?
Andy : I don’t know
Andy : Maybe I shouldn’t have done that
-> You :  I don’t think you should have done that
    Andy : Fudge.
    You : Fudge?
    Andy : Why did I do that?
    You : It's okay..
    You : She was probably trying to figure out the thing she was doing.
    You : Was it hard?
    Andy : I mean, it didn’t look hard?
    You : Maybe it was hard for her..
    Andy : …Maybe.
    Andy : I should go say sorry then.
-> You : Why did you tell her the answers
    Andy : I don’t know.
    You : Was it hard?
    Andy : It didn’t look hard.
    You : Maybe it was hard for her.
    Andy : Maybe..
    Andy : I should go say sorry then.
You : its ok
<<jump Andy_Victim_Questions>> 
===

title: Andy_Victim_Questions
---
