You : Now you know the problem, why don’t you go up to her yourself
Andy : I’m a little scared
You : Okayy

===

title: Andy_Victim_End
---
You : I managed to talk to Diana
Andy : hmm
You : What
Andy : okay
You : Do you want to do anything
