title: Evan_Victim_Start
---
*Evan sits alone by the Monkey Bars, He stares at the ground*
You : Hey!
*Evan looks up at you for a second, then he looks away*
You : Wanna be friends?
*He shakes his head*
You : Are you James' friend?
*His eyes widens but he also shakes his head*
You : Um.. can I sit here?
*He shrugs, you sit down but not too close to him*
-> You : I'm Lola. I'm new to the town..
    *Evan peeks at her.*
-> You : My name is Lola.
    *Evan peeks at her.*
You : What's your name?
*Silence fills the air for what feels like forever* 
You : So…
Evan : …Evan..
You : Oh! Hi Evan
<<set $knows_evan_name to true>> 
Evan : Hi.. Lola..
*A audible stomach growl, it came from Evan*
You : Did something happen?
*Evan nods*
Evan : Yeah.. 
You : Did someone bully you? Was it James?
Evan : Someone took my lunch money
You : Your lunch money? Who would do that?
Evan : Daniel.. He takes them everyday..
Evan : I’m hungry all the time
You : Thats evil..
Evan : And he keeps saying I suck at everything
Evan : I really do suck at everything
<<jump Evan_Victim_Questions>> 
===

title: Evan_Victim_Questions
---
-> You : Do you like to run? <<if not $asked_evan_run>>
    <<set $asked_evan_run to true>>
    *Evan's head pops up. It's the first time he looks at you for real.*
    Evan : Yeah!!
    Evan : I feel like i’m flying when I run!
    You: Woah!! Are you fast?
    Evan : mm...I don't know.
    Evan : I can run from here to the fence..
    Evan : When I count, I think it's ten seconds.
    You : Ten seconds?? Woah! That is really fast!
    Evan : Really?
    <<jump Evan_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : Can you do the monkey bars? <<if not $asked_evan_bars>>
    <<set $asked_evan_bars to true>>
    *Evan looks at the monkey bars. Then back at his shoes.*
    Evan : mm.. yeahh..
    You : Woah..
    Evan : I can skip two
    You : You skip TWO?
    Evan : ...It's not a big deal.. Daniel can do three at once
    You : What?? Don’t compare yourself to him! 
    You : I can’t even do one??
    Evan : ...Really?
    You : Really.
    *Evan almost smiles.*
    <<jump Evan_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : Do you know James? <<if $knows_james_name and not $asked_evan_james>>
    <<set $asked_evan_james to true>>
    Evan : The boy with the brown hair?
    *Evan whispers, even though nobody is close.*
    Evan : He sits at the top by himself.
    Lola : By himself?
    Evan : Lots of kids are near him.
    Evan : But he's still by himself.
    <<jump Evan_Victim_Questions>>
-> You : Do you want me to get your tickets back?
    Evan : You can't..
    Evan : Daniel's.. Bigger than us, bigger than me
    You : I'm not scared.
    -> You : I'll be careful.
        Evan : Okay.
    -> You : I'll try anyway.
        *Evan gives you a doubtful glance* 
        Evan : ...Okay.
    Evan : Thank you, Lola.
===

title: Evan_Victim_End
---
You : Evan! I got your money
*Surprised, he turns and looks up, to the money and then to you*
Evan : You did? Really? What?
Evan : How?
You : I beat Daniel at Arm Wrestling!!
Evan : Him?? You beat Daniel?? 
You : Yeah!
*Evan almost laughs. It comes out as a tiny snort.*
Evan : Thank you, Lola
*Daniel walks up with his arms crossed. He keeps his eyes on the ground.*
*Evan freezes*
Daniel : Hey.
Daniel : I'm... sorry I took your lunch money..
Evan : ...Okay.
*Evan's stomach growls again, loudly.*
*Daniel digs into his bag and holds out the chips.*
Daniel : Here.
Daniel : They were yours anyway.
Evan : ...Thanks.
Daniel : And you don't suck at everything.
Daniel : You run really fast and you can do monkey bars really well
Daniel : That's... kinda cool.
Daniel : I mean... whatever.
Evan : ...Really?
You : Really.
*Evan almost smiles. This time he really smiles.*
Evan : Do you want to see me do it?
Daniel : Fine. But only once.
*Evan runs to the monkey bars. He skips two and drops off the end in no time.*
Daniel : ...Whoa.
Evan : Do you want to try?
Daniel : Nah. I'd fall.
Evan : I can show you.
Daniel : ...Maybe later.
Evan : Lola?
Evan : Can I come with you?
You : Of course.
<<set $evan_following to true>>
*Daniel watches them go. He puts his hands in his pockets.*
Daniel : I'm not on your side.
You : I know.
Daniel : ...But I'm not on his side today.
===

