    Daniel : I’m a guy and you’re a girl.
    Daniel : Do you really want to fight?
    You : If I win, you give the money back.
    Daniel : And if I win?
    You : Then I'll leave you alone.
    Daniel : Deal..
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "arm">>
===

title: Daniel_Bully_Midpoint
---
Daniel : What?! 
Daniel : Bro, you just got lucky
You : Oh hey I won
Daniel : Hold on, best of two
You : You’re.. Breathing really hard, just say you lost
Daniel : I'm NOT.
You : Can I ask you something then while you take a break
Daniel : Ugh. What do you want
You : Why do you say Evan sucks at everything?
Daniel : Because he does..
You : Does he?
Daniel : ...Okay, the monkey bars.
Daniel : I can skip three bars.
Daniel : But I fall off every time.
Daniel : Evan skips two, and he goes all the way across super fast.
Daniel : And he never falls.
Daniel : It's so annoying.
You : That sounds really good.
Daniel : ...
Daniel : It's kind of cool.
Daniel : Don't say anything.
You : Why not?
Daniel : If James hears me, he'll look at me weird.
You : Weird how?
Daniel : Like I'm not cool anymore.
You : Is that scary?
Daniel : ...A little.
Daniel : Okay, last round.
Daniel : And I'm not holding back this time.
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "arm">>
===

title: Daniel_Bully_End
---
*Daniel looks at the table, defeated*
Daniel : Huh..
Daniel : I lost? To a girl?
You : Yeah you did 
Daniel : And you’re the new kid too
You : You were good too though
You : Don’t beat yourself over it, but don’t take Evan’s lunch money anymore okay?
Daniel : Ah..
*He reaches into his pockets, and he reveals the crumbled up dollar bills to you*
Daniel : Here.. I’ve been saving up  but, these are rightfully Evans.. So..
You : Thanks!
You : I think you should say sorry to him..
Daniel : …
Daniel : Sure.. *He turns away shy*
<<set $daniel_following to true>>
===

